      "content": "that's terrifying. if they're already optimizing it to make the digital version more \"relevant\" than me, then how do i even fight this? is there any way to leave a \"mark\" on my digital footprint that the AI wouldn't be able to replicate? something like a piece of data or a behavioral pattern that is so uniquely human and chaotic that a machine could never simulate it?",
